    "Scan of the 1966 edition of the Bristol, Connecticut, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1943; aerial photographs from 1972; photo inspected in 1976; photo revised in 1972; last revised in 1966; printed in 1983.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
